# This repository has zero third-party dependencies by design, and CI has no install step so that
# adding one breaks the build rather than passing unnoticed. These entries exist to catch a local
# `npm install` before it reaches a commit — not to make room for dependencies.
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# Local CI results. Evidence of a run on one developer's machine, regenerated by every run and
# meaningful only next to the working copy that produced it. The repository's intentional evidence
# lives under artifacts/release/ and artifacts/adoption/ and is committed on purpose; this is not
# that, and committing it would put a transient verdict beside frozen ones that were reviewed.
artifacts/local-ci/

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
